      "correct": 1,
      "explanation": "After no, use the negative word: no hay nadie (there's nobody).",
      "optionNotes": [
        "After no, Spanish uses the negative word nadie.",
        null,
        "Algo is for things, and after no you need the negative word.",
        "Ningún needs a noun after it."
